<<default>>
	/* 7PM-2AM: Weekend Night. */
	<<if $bailey_monogamous>>
		You knock on Bailey's door. You hear muffled footsteps before Bailey opens the door. <<He>> looks you over, says nothing, and steps aside to let you in.
