		<br>
		<<link [[Leave|Flats]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
		<br>
	<<else>>
		You knock on Bailey's door. You hear muffled footsteps before Bailey opens the door. <<He>> has an unlit cigarette between <<his>> lips.
		<br><br>
		<<if Time.isWeekEnd()>>
			<<if random(1, 2) is 1>>
				You hear someone inside giggling.
			<<else>>
				You hear someone inside call for Bailey to come back.
			<</if>>
			<br><br>
		<</if>>
		<<He>> glances you over. "What are you doing here, brat? Don't answer that. Leave."
		<br><br>
